              "__typename": "User",
              "login": "grimulkan"
            },
            "body": "@LucasWilkinson Are you still working on this? Otherwise I can do a separate compatibility PR where DCP works as it currently does (in bf16) and then quantizes to fp8 if that's what is needed. It unlocks usage of fp8 KV Cache with DCP, leaving the optimization of DCP comms for later. That's the idea in principle at least, haven't fully tested it out.\r\n\r\nAny preferences?\r\n\r\nThis would synergize with https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/34597 on expanding Triton MLA to fp8 KV.",
